genie
=====

A deterministic reimplementation of the Age of Empires II: Definitive Edition engine, plus readers
and writers for the game's file formats.

Licences
--------

- Format crates, crates/formats/*: GPL-3.0-only (genie-drs: GPL-3.0-or-later). Text: LICENSE-GPL-3.0.
- Engine crates, crates/engine/*: AGPL-3.0-only. Text: LICENSE-AGPL-3.0.
- Tool crates, crates/tools/* (genie-swiss-knife, the `gsk` command; genie-oracle, the checks
  against recorded games): AGPL-3.0-only. Text: LICENSE-AGPL-3.0.

Engine and tool crates may depend on format crates, and tool crates on engine crates. Format crates
never depend on engine or tool crates, so a GPL crate never pulls in AGPL code.

Origin of the format crates
---------------------------

The crates under crates/formats/ continue genie-rs (https://github.com/SiegeEngineers/genie-rs),
written mainly by Renée Kooi (goto-bus-stop) with its contributors. They were imported with their
full history on 2026-10-15; the root umbrella crate `genie` became `genie-formats`.

